{'symbol': 'LOW', 'date': '2023-02-03 16:15:00', 'title': "LOWE'S COMPLETES SALE OF CANADIAN RETAIL BUSINESS TO SYCAMORE PARTNERS", 'text': "MOORESVILLE, N.C. , FEB. 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LOWE'S COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: LOW) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE SALE OF ITS CANADIAN RETAIL BUSINESS TO SYCAMORE PARTNERS, A PRIVATE EQUITY FIRM SPECIALIZING IN RETAIL, CONSUMER AND DISTRIBUTION-RELATED INVESTMENTS."}